<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Plant Fact Sheet</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial; }
        .header-bar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .logo-area { display: flex; align-items: center; }
        .logo-img { width: 60px; height: 60px; margin-right: 15px; }
        .title-area h1 { font-size: 24pt; margin: 0; }
        .title-area p { font-size: 10pt; margin: 0; color: #555; }
        .metadata { text-align: right; font-size: 10pt; }
        .content-section { margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .section-title { font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc; padding-bottom: 5px; }
        .two-column-layout { display: flex; gap: 40px; }
        .column { flex: 1; }
        .image-container { text-align: center; margin-top: 20px; }
        .image-container img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; }
        .caption { font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 5px; }
        .data-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; }
        .data-table td { padding: 8px 0; font-size: 10pt; }
        .data-table .label { font-weight: bold; width: 30%; }
        .divider { border-top: 1px solid #ccc; margin: 30px 0; }
        .footer { font-size: 8pt; text-align: center; margin-top: 50px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <div class="header-bar">
            <div class="logo-area">
                <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" class="logo-img">
                <div class="title-area">
                    <h1>UNIVERSITY OF GUAM</h1>
                    <p>COOPERATIVE EXTENSION & OUTREACH</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="metadata">
                <p>Cooperative Extension & Outreach</p>
                <p>Native Plants of Guam</p>
                <p>FS001-19</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="content-section">
            <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 36pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">AMAHATYAN</h1>
            <h2 style="text-align: center; font-size: 24pt; margin-top: 0;">Pipturus argenteus</h2>
            <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0;">{{ author_name_1 }} and {{ author_name_2 }}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="two-column-layout">
            <div class="column">
                <div class="content-section">
                    <p>A <span data-field="description_summary">{{ description_summary }}</span> is a small tree that grows primarily on limestone/coraline soils. It is mostly found on coastal/strand areas, open sites, and edges of limestone forests.</p>
                    <p><strong>Other Common Names:</strong> <span data-field="other_names_list">{{ other_names_list }}</span></p>
                    <p><strong>Synonyms:</strong> <span data-field="synonyms_list">{{ synonyms_list }}</span></p>
                    <p><strong>Family Name:</strong> <span data-field="family_name">{{ family_name }}</span></p>

                    <div class="section-title">Plant appearance</div>
                    <p><strong>Distinctive feature:</strong> The leaves are palmatey veined, grayish underneath with coarse serrations in the margins. It has small, white fruits that are edible and sweet which are clustered at the nodes that look like tiny strawberries.</p>

                    <div class="section-title">Leaf</div>
                    <p><strong>Shape:</strong> <span data-field="leaf_shape">{{ leaf_shape }}</span></p>
                    <p><strong>Arrangement:</strong> <span data-field="leaf_arrangement">{{ leaf_arrangement }}</span></p>
                    <p><strong>Type:</strong> <span data-field="leaf_type">{{ leaf_type }}</span></p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="column">
                <div class="image-container">
                    <img src="placeholder_image_1.jpg" alt="Amahatyan flowers">
                    <p class="caption">Amahatyan flowers*.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="content-section" style="margin-top: 20px;">
                    <div class="section-title">Flower</div>
                    <p><strong>Size:</strong> About <span data-field="flower_size">{{ flower_size }}</span>.</p>
                    <p><strong>Color:</strong> <span data-field="flower_color">{{ flower_color }}</span>.</p>
                    <p><strong>Shape:</strong> <span data-field="flower_shape">{{ flower_shape }}</span>.</p>
                    <p><strong>Arrangement:</strong> <span data-field="flower_arrangement">{{ flower_arrangement }}</span>.</p>
                    <p><strong>Flowering period:</strong> <span data-field="flower_period">{{ flower_period }}</span>.</p>
                    <p><strong>Habit:</strong></p>
                    <p><strong>Typical height:</strong> Up to <span data-field="typical_height">{{ typical_height }}</span>.</p>
                    <p><strong>Fruit:</strong></p>
                    <p><strong>Size:</strong> Up to <span data-field="fruit_size">{{ fruit_size }}</span> in diameter.</p>
                    <p><strong>Color:</strong> <span data-field="fruit_color">{{ fruit_color }}</span>.</p>
                    <p><strong>Number of seeds:</strong> <span data-field="seed_count">{{ seed_count }}</span>.</p>
                    <p><strong>Edible:</strong> <span data-field="edible_status">{{ edible_status }}</span>.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="image-container" style="margin-top: 30px;">
                    <img src="placeholder_image_2.jpg" alt="Amahatyan leaves">
                    <p class="caption">Amahatyan leaves*.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <div class="two-column-layout">
            <div class="column">
                <div class="content-section">
                    <div class="section-title">Growing your own</div>
                    <p><strong>Form:</strong> <span data-field="growing_form">{{ growing_form }}</span></p>
                    <p><strong>Seed collection:</strong> Collect seeds from mature and healthy fruits on the tree. Dry them.</p>
                    <p><strong>Seed treatment:</strong> None</p>
                    <p><strong>Germination time:</strong> <span data-field="germination_time">{{ germination_time }}</span></p>
                    <p><strong>Planting depth:</strong> Not deeper than twice the size of the seed</p>
                    <p><strong>Pre-planting:</strong> Germinate in individual pots when possible. Plants grown in 1-gallon pots should be transplanted into the ground after 4-6 months.</p>
                    <p><strong>Special hints:</strong> When outplanted, it is best to plant during the months of August-October. Supplemental watering may be required up to 6 months.</p>

                    <div class="section-title">Production conditions</div>
                    <p><strong>pH value:</strong> <span data-field="ph_value">{{ ph_value }}</span> (neutral)</p>
                    <p><strong>Water:</strong> Needs sufficient water but can tolerate drought</p>
                    <p><strong>Salt tolerance:</strong> High</p>
                    <p><strong>Wind tolerance:</strong> Low</p>
                    <p><strong>Soil characteristics:</strong> Good drainage</p>
                    <p><strong>Light:</strong> Full sun</p>
                    <p><strong>Space requirement:</strong> 8-12 ft.</p>
                    <p><strong>Growth rate:</strong> <span data-field="growth_rate">{{ growth_rate }}</span> per year</p>
                    <p><strong>Growth direction:</strong> Spreading</p>
                    <p><strong>Fertilizer:</strong> Potting media composed of peat moss, perlite, and vermiculite combined with low-release fertilizer and compost is highly recommended.</p>
                    <p><strong>Pruning:</strong> Prune dead branches. Prune as necessary for structure and crown thinning. Prune no more than 25 percent of plant every 4-6 months.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="column">
                <div class="image-container">
                    <img src="placeholder_image_3.jpg" alt="Amahatyan seeds">
                    <p class="caption">Amahatyan seeds*.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="content-section" style="margin-top: 20px;">
                    <div class="section-title">Risks</div>
                    <p><strong>Near surface roots:</strong> None</p>
                    <p><strong>Limb breakage:</strong> Medium</p>
                    <p><strong>Special considerations:</strong> None</p>
                    <p><strong>Pests:</strong> Leafminer (Lepidoptera), Stigmella ebbenielseni, sp. nov.</p>

                    <div class="section-title">How to use this plant</div>
                    <p>Amahatyan is a fast-growing plant that is good for revegetation.</p>
                    <p><strong>Agroforestry:</strong> Screen</p>
                    <p><strong>Wildlife:</strong> Food source</p>
                    <p><strong>Medicinal:</strong> Used for herbal medicine</p>
                    <p><strong>Other uses:</strong> Fiber for fishing lines, cordage, brown dye (bark)</p>
                </div>

                <div class="image-container" style="margin-top: 30px;">
                    <img src="placeholder_image_4.jpg" alt="Amahatyan seedling">
                    <p class="caption">Amahatyan seedling*.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            For more information on Cooperative Extension & Outreach, visit <a href="http://cnas-re.uog.edu/">http://cnas-re.uog.edu/</a> or call 1.671.735.2080 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; FS001-19 | 1
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div class="content-section" style="margin-top: 0;">
            <div class="section-title">Photo credits</div>
            <p>a. <span data-field="photo_credit_1">{{ photo_credit_1 }}</span></p>
        </div>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <div class="content-section">
            <div class="section-title">Acknowledgements</div>
            <p>Special thanks to <span data-field="acknowledgement_person_1">{{ acknowledgement_person_1 }}</span> for his valuable contributions in the completion of this factsheet.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <div class="content-section">
            <div class="section-title">For further information</div>
            <p>Forestry & Soil Resources Division</p>
            <p>Guam Department of Agriculture</p>
            <p>Phone: <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></p>
            <p>Fax: <span data-field="fax_number">{{ fax_number }}</span></p>
            <p><span data-field="address_line_1">{{ address_line_1 }}</span>, <span data-field="address_city">{{ address_city }}</span>, <span data-field="address_zip">{{ address_zip }}</span></p>
            <p><span data-field="website_url">{{ website_url }}</span></p>
        </div>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <div class="content-section">
            <div class="section-title">References</div>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="{{ reference_url_1 }}">{{ reference_title_1 }}</a></li>
                <li><a href="{{ reference_url_2 }}">{{ reference_title_2 }}</a></li>
                <li><a href="{{ reference_url_3 }}">{{ reference_title_3 }}</a></li>
                <li><a href="{{ reference_url_4 }}">{{ reference_title_4 }}</a></li>
                <li><a href="{{ reference_url_5 }}">{{ reference_title_5 }}</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <div class="content-section">
            <div class="section-title">In cooperation with</div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px;">
                <img src="placeholder_partner_logo_1.png" alt="Partner Logo 1" style="height: 50px;">
                <img src="placeholder_partner_logo_2.png" alt="Partner Logo 2" style="height: 50px;">
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
